  "description": "*\"Me, me, really, should I get pregnant...?\"*\n\nYu-Ju was sold into a cult but was barely saved by Tae-Seong. She fell in love with Tae-Seong's kindness, but she voluntarily went to the cult to pay her younger sister's medical bills. When they met again several months later, Tae-Seong had become a completely different person and demanded a child from Yu-Ju...! \n\n*\"Stop talking nonsense and just accept it.\"\n\"...\"\n\"If you want money, you should listen to me.\"*\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
